Bind fact to is-safe, given (the series of number board, the number column):
    Define row as the number of board + 1.
    Define counter as 1.
    While counter is less than row, repeat:
        Define other-column as item counter of board.
        Define diff as row - counter.
        If other-column is column:
            Return 1 = 0.
        Done.
        If column - other-column is diff:
            Return 1 = 0.
        Done.
        If other-column - column is diff:
            Return 1 = 0.
        Done.
        The counter becomes counter + 1.
    Done.
    Return 1 = 1.
Done.

Bind void to solve, given (the series of number board, the number n):
    If the number of board is n:
        Define out as "".
        For each queen in board, repeat:
            The out becomes out joined to (queen converted to text) joined to " ".
        Done.
        State "Solution: " joined to out.
        Return.
    Done.
    Define column as 1.
    While column is less than n + 1, repeat:
        If cast is-safe on (board, column):
            Add column to board.
            Cast solve on (board, n).
            Remove item (the number of board) from board.
        Done.
        The column becomes column + 1.
    Done.
Done.

Define board as a series of number.
Cast solve on (board, 4).
